  { w: 'cultural', pos: 'adj.', zh: '文化的', lv: 3, ex: 'The international festival is a great chance to learn about cultural differences.', exZh: '國際文化節是認識文化差異的好機會。' },
  { w: 'curiosity', pos: 'n.', zh: '好奇心', lv: 4, ex: 'Out of curiosity, I opened the old box I found in my grandmother\'s house.', exZh: '出於好奇，我打開了在奶奶家找到的舊箱子。' },
  { w: 'cycle', pos: 'n./v.', zh: '循環；週期；騎腳踏車', lv: 3, ex: 'In earth science class, we learned how the water cycle works.', exZh: '地科課上，我們學到水循環如何運作。' }
